Angelika the chaotic elven wizard was having a fine time in the
dungeons with her pet guardian naga Toonces, until she got separated
from him because of an incovenient teleport trap. When she found him
again, he was peaceful but not tame. She tried a scroll of taming on
him without effect. She's guessing that this is because of the naga's
magic resistance. She's wondering if this is correct. Will a scroll of
taming change a peaceful creature into a pet (tame), or do they only
work on hostile creatures. The spoilers suggest that they should work.

